{"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"@","kind":"attribute"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:ScM","text":"MainActor","kind":"attribute"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"MISOTextInput","kind":"identifier"}]}]},{"content":[{"level":2,"anchor":"Layout","type":"heading","text":"Layout"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Text input is based on several configurable UI elements:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"label"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":": It is used to describe the purpose of the input."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"In some UI contexts, especially when space is limited or when the input is part of a compact layout (search bars, filters, inline forms), the label can be hidden."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"However, hiding the label should only be done if the purpose of the input remains clear thanks to a placeholder or contextual icon"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and if the label is still accessible to screen readers"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Hiding a label is a design choice that must balance visual simplicity and clarity of intent, without compromising inclusiveness or form guidance."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"placeholder","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":": if the text of the text input is empty a placeholder provides a hint or guidance inside the field to suggest expected input."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"A prefix and a suffix can be added to give more context."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"leading icon","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":": it helps indicate the purpose of the input (magnifying glass for search, envelope for email, phone device for phone number)."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Only use a leading icon if it adds clear functional or contextual value."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"trailing action"}]},{"type":"text","text":": it is used to provide actions related to the field: clear input, toggle password visibility, open a date picker, etc."},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Can also indicate status or feedback (error checkmark, loading spinner).","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"Outlined-style","text":"Outlined style"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"By "},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"default","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":", the input is with a subtle background fill and invisible bottom border, creating a softer and more contained look."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Best suited for dense layouts or to enhance visibility."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"When "},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"outlined","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":", the text input is a minimalist design with a transparent background and a visible stroke outlining the field."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"This style may be interesting for contexts other than form pages:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"When inputs need to feel lightweight and unobtrusive","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"In a header (search field)","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"In a selection\/filtering feature in a product catalog","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["   \/\/ An outlined text input","   MISOTextInput(label: \"Label\", text: $text, isOutlined: true)","","   \/\/ With a localizable and a bundle","   MISOTextInput(LocalizedStringKey(\"label_wording\"), bundle: Bundle.module, text: $text)"]},{"text":"Rounded layout","type":"heading","level":3,"anchor":"Rounded-layout"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Text input can have rounded layouts to be favored in more emotional, immersive contexts or those tied to specific visual identities.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"For standard or business-oriented journeys, keep the default corners.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"This evolution addresses the need for flexibility in adapting the design to some brand contexts.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"To activate the rounded corner behavior, set to true the ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"hasRoundedTextInputs"},{"type":"text","text":" values of the "},{"code":"Tuning","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" object"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"in your theme configuration (if the theme exposes this property at init)."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Some themes do not have this flexibility, like "},{"code":"BlueCoatTheme","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":2,"text":"Status","anchor":"Status","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Five status are proposed for all layouts:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"default (by default)"}]},{"type":"text","text":": Default neutral appearance, whether empty or filled."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"It allows users to click, focus, and type freely without restrictions."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"error","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":": The "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"error"},{"type":"text","text":" status indicates that the user input does not meet validation rules or"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"expected formatting. It provides immediate visual feedback, typically through a red border,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"error icon, and a clear, accessible error message positioned below the input. The error messages replaces the helper text."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"loading"}]},{"type":"text","text":": The "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"loading"},{"type":"text","text":" state indicates that the system is processing or retrieving data"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"related to the text entered. A progress indicator appears to inform the user that an action is in progress."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"readOnly"}]},{"type":"text","text":" :The"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"readOnly"},{"type":"text","text":", lets the text visible but not editable"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"disabled"}]},{"type":"text","text":": In "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"disabled"},{"type":"text","text":" status, the field is non-interactive and grayed out to indicate it cannot be changed."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Note the SwiftUI "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"View.disabled()"},{"type":"text","text":" is ignored."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"level":2,"text":"Helpers","anchor":"Helpers","type":"heading"},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Helper text"}]},{"type":"text","text":":  A supporting text conveys additional information about the input field,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"such as how it will be used. It should ideally only take up a single line, though may wrap"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"to multiple lines if required, and be either persistently visible or visible only on focus."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Helper link"}]},{"type":"text","text":": If the helper text is not sufficient, it’s possible to offer the user"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"an additional help link (the link can be external or open a modal)."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"level":2,"text":"Accessibility considerations","anchor":"Accessibility-considerations","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"By default no haptics are done by the component for the trailing action."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"However you should think about cases wher you will have to make the devices vibrates."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"You can refer to the "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"https:\/\/developer.apple.com\/design\/human-interface-guidelines\/playing-haptics"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":2,"text":"Mandatory field indication","anchor":"Mandatory-field-indication","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If all fields are mandatory (several fields present): display the message “All fields are mandatory” at the top of your form."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Do not use an asterisk at the end of each field label, nor the word “mandatory.”"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If not all fields are mandatory (several fields present): display the message “All fields marked with an * are mandatory” at the top of your form."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Use an asterisk (*) at the end of each mandatory field label, and ensures this is well vocalized."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"UI rendering of the asterisk must be done with "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"bold font weight","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"negative content color","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" (red on light backgrounds)."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Use the mention “(optional)” at the end of each optional field label. Note that this rule is not systematic, it remains an option, to be used if needed."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If there is only one field in the form, or if the mandatory nature is obvious (such as login\/password),"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"no mention is necessary since the fields are essential to the form’s functionality."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":2,"text":"Rich text","anchor":"Rich-text","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Rich text can be used for error and helper texts."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Strong text can be used sparingly to highlight key information within the content."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"No other text styles should be used."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Underlined text must not be applied manually (e.g. in error message), as it is commonly associated with hyperlinks and may mislead users."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":2,"text":"Code samples","anchor":"Code-samples","type":"heading"},{"code":["    \/\/ The text to display and edit","    @State var text: String = \"\"","","    \/\/ Empty text and no placeholder","    MISOTextInput(label: \"Email\", text: $text)","","    \/\/ Empty text with placeholder and suffix","    MISOTextInput(label: \"Email\", text: $text, placeholder: \"firstName.lastName\", suffix: \"@orange.com\")","","    \/\/ Empty text with prefix and suffix","    MISOTextInput(label: \"Email\", text: $text, prefix: \"Distance\", suffix: \"km\")","","    \/\/ Add a leading icon for more context","    MISOTextInput(label: \"Email\", text: $text, placeholder: \"firstName.lastName\", suffix: \"@orange.com\",","                  leadingImage: MISOImage(asset: Image(systemName: \"envelope\")))","","    \/\/ Add a leading icon displayed as raw image (not tinted)","    MISOTextInput(label: \"Brand\", text: $text,","                  leadingImage: MISOImage(asset: Image(\"ic_brand\"), renderingMode: .original))","","    \/\/ Flip the leading icon for RTL layouts using MISOImage.flipped","    MISOTextInput(label: \"Label\", text: $text,","                  leadingImage: MISOImage(asset: Image(\"ic_arrow\"), flipped: layoutDirection == .rightToLeft))","","    \/\/ Add a trailing button with local image named \"ic_cross\" for additional action","    let trailingAction = MISOTextInput.TrailingAction(image: MISOImage(asset: Image(\"ic_cross\")), actionHint: \"Delete\") { text = \"\" }","    MISOTextInput(label: \"Email\", text: $text, trailingAction: trailingAction)","","    \/\/ With helper text","    MISOTextInput(label: \"Email\",","                  text: $text,","                  placeholder: \"firstName.lastName\",","                  suffix: \"@orange.com\",","                  helperText: \"The email will be automatically completed with @orange.com\")","","    \/\/ With helper link","    @Environment(\\.openURL) private var openUrl","","    let helperLink = MISOTextInput.HelperLink(text: \"Helper Link\") {","       openUrl.callAsFunction(url)","    }","","    MISOTextInput(label: \"Label\", text: $text, placeholder: \"Placeholder\", helperLink: helperLink)"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If you need to flip your leading icon for RTL, use the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"flipped"},{"type":"text","text":" property of "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOImage"},{"type":"text","text":":"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["    @Environment(\\.layoutDirection) var layoutDirection","","    MISOTextInput(label: \"Label\", text: $text,","                  leadingImage: MISOImage(asset: Image(\"ic_arrow\"), flipped: layoutDirection == .rightToLeft))"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"1.4.1 (Figma component design version)","type":"text"}]}],"style":"note","name":"Version","type":"aside"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"OUDS 0.20.0","type":"text"}]}],"style":"note","name":"Since","type":"aside"}],"kind":"content"}],"metadata":{"platforms":[{"unavailable":false,"introducedAt":"15.0","deprecated":false,"beta":false,"name":"iOS"},{"unavailable":false,"introducedAt":"13.0","deprecated":false,"beta":false,"name":"macOS"},{"unavailable":false,"introducedAt":"1.0","deprecated":false,"beta":false,"name":"visionOS"}],"role":"symbol","modules":[{"name":"Components"}],"title":"MISOTextInput","symbolKind":"struct","externalID":"s:14MISOComponents13MISOTextInputV","roleHeading":"Structure","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"MISOTextInput","kind":"identifier"}],"fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"MISOTextInput","kind":"identifier"}]},"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"minor":3,"major":0},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOTextInput","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/misocomponents\/misotextinput"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"sections":[],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents"]]},"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"Text input is a UI element that allows to enter, edit, or select single-line textual data.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Text input is one of the most fundamental form elements used to capture user input such as names, emails, passwords, or search queries.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"It provides a visual and interactive affordance for text entry while supporting labels, placeholders, icons, descriptions, and validation feedback.","type":"text"}],"topicSections":[{"title":"Structures","generated":true,"anchor":"Structures","identifiers":["doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOTextInput\/Helperlink","doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOTextInput\/TrailingAction"]},{"title":"Initializers","generated":true,"anchor":"Initializers","identifiers":["doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOTextInput\/init(_:tableName:bundle:text:placeholder:prefix:suffix:leadingImage:trailingAction:helperText:helperLink:isOutlined:constrainedMaxWidth:status:)-3rr11","doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOTextInput\/init(_:tableName:bundle:text:placeholder:prefix:suffix:leadingImage:trailingAction:helperText:helperLink:isOutlined:constrainedMaxWidth:status:)-72xdt","doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOTextInput\/init(label:text:placeholder:prefix:suffix:leadingImage:trailingAction:helperText:helperLink:isOutlined:constrainedMaxWidth:status:)-6fuf2","doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOTextInput\/init(label:text:placeholder:prefix:suffix:leadingImage:trailingAction:helperText:helperLink:isOutlined:constrainedMaxWidth:status:)-6g04k"]},{"anchor":"Instance-Properties","identifiers":["doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOTextInput\/body"],"title":"Instance Properties","generated":true},{"anchor":"Enumerations","identifiers":["doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOTextInput\/Status"],"title":"Enumerations","generated":true},{"anchor":"Default-Implementations","identifiers":["doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOTextInput\/View-Implementations","doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/M